    "updated_at": "2019-04-01T15:22:03Z",
    "body": "Note however we may want to consider defining this feature more holistically. For example custom elements, and I believe worklet APIs, want to not only construct the constructor, but pull properties off of it (e.g. step 10 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#dom-customelementregistry-define). That could lead to different syntax.",
